        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;Customer, Staff and Admin use separate account entry points. Only their own permitted fields can change.&#10;Admin Gmail changes use emailed verification when its storage is installed. Staff and Customer use their existing update path.&#10;Password changes require the current password; unchanged forms cannot submit. Read-only Staff name stays protected." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
